  "conclusion": {
    "supports_B5_in_GBM": false,
    "reason": "No public RECIST/ORR labels exist for GBM ICI RNA. In GSE121810, CLDN4 is below 1 CPM in 26/29 tumors. An unadjusted continuous Cox OS association (HR 2.52, p=0.019) is leverage from two samples above that floor and is gone after they are removed (p=0.55). Median-split OS, Spearman, OS>=365d, pretreatment adjuvant arm, and two larger wrong-strand matrices do not confirm a usable CLDN4 response biomarker in glioma."
  }
